        <target state="translated">诊断包已导出：{0}</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="DiagnosticsExportedPartial">
      <segment>
        <source>Diagnostics exported without service details ({0}). UI logs and readable service logs are included.</source>
        <target state="translated">诊断包已导出，但未包含服务端信息（{0}），已收集界面日志和能读取到的服务日志。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="DiagnosticsExportFailed">
      <segment>
        <source>Failed to export diagnostics: {0}</source>
        <target state="translated">导出诊断包失败：{0}</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="DiagnosticsCommandLineHint">
      <segment>
        <source>If this window cannot open, run “Export diagnostics” in the installation folder (NetworkControl.exe --export-diagnostics); the package is saved to the desktop.</source>
        <target state="translated">界面无法打开时，可以运行安装目录中的“导出诊断包”（NetworkControl.exe --export-diagnostics），诊断包会保存到桌面。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
