      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="ImportModeReplaceHint">
      <segment>
        <source>Make your rules match the file: rules that are not in the file are deleted. Built-in and temporary rules are kept.</source>
        <target state="translated">使规则与文件一致：文件中没有的规则会被删除。内置规则和临时规则不受影响。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
